      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '

    hello! welcome to, one of, if not THE biggest updates in the history
    of goober island.

    it might not seem like much is diffrent, but under the
    hood, this update makes updates way eaiser to make! heres whats new!


    -
    Recoded the ENTIRE game!

    -- (Quite literally the entire game is diffrent)

    -
    Better graphics

    - New movement!

    -- More like old movement, because
    the movement system is now the karlson movement again!

    - New cosmetics

    ==
    Bug Fixes ==

    - None, since this is a new project

    - Probally added bugs.'
